{"id":"00420","root":"uni00420_1","name":{"ja":"大島　雫","en":"Ooshima Shizuku"},"title":{"ja":"【ちっぱい雫】","en":"【Flat-Chested Shizuku】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【ちっぱい雫】 大島　雫","en":"【Flat-Chested Shizuku】 Ooshima Shizuku"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2021-01-15","limited":false,"characterId":31,"profile":{"ja":"格闘技系の対魔忍。テンションが高く突っ込み満載の関西系。親の長期任務で関西に行っていたが、対魔忍の能力に目覚めて五車学園に転入した。クラスでもムードメーカーで、対魔忍の厳しい試練も笑顔とノリで明るく元気にこなすその姿は学園内でも有名。体を動かすことが得意で肌は日に焼けた褐色。コンプレックスは胸が小さいことで、ゆきかぜ以上の貧乳ゆえにちっぱい雫と裏で呼ばれている。胸の大きな人物を見ると負けたとその場で崩れてしまいｏｒｚ状態になる。時たま、同じクラスでしっかり者の大和恵梨とタッグを組んで任務に取り組んでいる。今回も長期任務から帰還したが、このとき着用していた対魔忍衣装は彼女専用に製作されたプロトタイプ衣装であった。","en":"She is a martial-arts style Taimanin with a high-energy, joke-filled Kansai personality. After her parents were assigned to a long-term mission in Kansai, she eventually awakened her Taimanin abilities and transferred to Gosha Academy. In class she's the mood-maker, tackling the academy's harsh trials with a bright smile and lively spirit, a reputation that's spread throughout the school. She excels at physical activity, her skin tanned from the sun, and she has a modest bust that she feels a bit self-conscious about. Seniors call her \"the tiny-chested Shizuku\" behind her back, noting she's even flatter-chested than Mizuki Yukikaze. When she sees someone with a large chest, she collapses on the spot in an \"orz\" pose, feeling defeated. Occasionally she teams up with the diligent senior Yamato Eri on missions. This time she's returned from a long-term mission, wearing a prototype Taimanin outfit specially made for her."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"柏木逢花","forms":[{"id":"uni00420_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1072,2144],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[158,316],"def":[104,208],"spd":[57,57],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["1","940007"]},{"id":"uni00420_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1644,3288],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[251,502],"def":[143,286],"spd":[57,57],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["1","940007","940008"]},{"id":"uni00420_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2216,4417],"sp":[320,320],"atk":[349,700],"def":[187,375],"spd":[57,57],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["1","940007","940008"]}],"skills":{"1":{"slot":"attack","id":1,"name":null,"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Superhuman damage","tag":"instant"}]},"940007":{"slot":"skill1","id":940007,"name":{"ja":"誰がちっぱいだ！"},"hits":6,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、DEFを小ダウンする"},"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 270% Superhuman damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: DEF -15% for 4 turns","icon":"def_down","tag":"debuff"}]},{"level":2,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、DEFを小ダウンする"},"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 273% Superhuman damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: DEF -15% for 4 turns","icon":"def_down","tag":"debuff"}]},{"level":3,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、DEFを小ダウンする"},"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 277% Superhuman damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: DEF -15% for 4 turns","icon":"def_down","tag":"debuff"}]},{"level":4,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、DEFを小ダウンする"},"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 281% Superhuman damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: DEF -15% for 4 turns","icon":"def_down","tag":"debuff"}]},{"level":5,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、DEFを小ダウンする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 285% Superhuman damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: DEF -15% for 4 turns","icon":"def_down","tag":"debuff"}]},"940008":{"slot":"skill2","id":940008,"name":{"ja":"轟風乱破"},"hits":6,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で３～６回攻撃する"},"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 3–1 hits (random) of 120% Superhuman damage","tag":"instant"}]},{"level":2,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で３～６回攻撃する"},"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 3–1 hits (random) of 125% Superhuman damage","tag":"instant"}]},{"level":3,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で３～６回攻撃する"},"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 3–1 hits (random) of 130% Superhuman damage","tag":"instant"}]},{"level":4,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で３～６回攻撃する"},"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 3–1 hits (random) of 135% Superhuman damage","tag":"instant"}]},{"level":5,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で３～６回攻撃する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 3–1 hits (random) of 140% Superhuman damage","tag":"instant"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"ちっぱい"},"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ユニットのSPDを大アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"Superhuman allies: SPD +20%","icon":"spd_up","tag":"passive"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":1,"gold":1,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00002",80],[1,"blo00005",1],[2,"blo00007",15],[3,"blo00010",15],[4,"blo00013",15],[5,"blo00007",15],[6,"blo00010",15],[7,"blo00013",15],[8,"blo00007",15],[9,"blo00010",10],[9,"blo00011",10],[10,"blo00007",10],[10,"blo00008",10],[11,"blo00013",10],[11,"blo00014",10],[12,"blo00002",160],[12,"blo00005",2],[13,"blo00007",10],[13,"blo00008",10],[14,"blo00010",10],[14,"blo00011",10],[15,"blo00013",10],[15,"blo00014",10],[16,"blo00007",10],[16,"blo00008",10],[17,"blo00010",10],[17,"blo00011",10],[18,"blo00013",10],[18,"blo00014",10],[19,"blo00007",10],[19,"blo00008",10],[20,"blo00010",5],[20,"blo00011",15],[20,"blo00012",5],[21,"blo00007",5],[21,"blo00008",15],[21,"blo00009",5],[22,"blo00013",5],[22,"blo00014",15],[22,"blo00015",5],[23,"blo00010",5],[23,"blo00011",15],[23,"blo00012",5],[24,"blo00007",5],[24,"blo00008",15],[24,"blo00009",5],[25,"blo00013",5],[25,"blo00014",15],[25,"blo00015",5],[26,"blo00002",80],[26,"blo00005",1],[27,"blo00008",3],[27,"blo00011",3],[27,"blo00014",3],[28,"blo00008",3],[28,"blo00011",3],[28,"blo00014",3],[29,"blo00008",3],[29,"blo00011",3],[29,"blo00014",3],[30,"blo00008",3],[30,"blo00011",3],[30,"blo00014",3],[31,"blo00002",160],[31,"blo00005",2],[32,"blo00008",3],[32,"blo00011",3],[32,"blo00014",3],[33,"blo00008",3],[33,"blo00011",3],[33,"blo00014",3],[34,"blo00008",3],[34,"blo00011",3],[34,"blo00014",3],[35,"blo00008",3],[35,"blo00011",3],[35,"blo00014",3],[36,"blo00002",160],[36,"blo00005",2],[37,"blo00008",3],[37,"blo00011",3],[37,"blo00014",3],[38,"blo00008",3],[38,"blo00011",3],[38,"blo00014",3],[39,"blo00008",3],[39,"blo00011",3],[39,"blo00014",3],[40,"blo00008",3],[40,"blo00011",3],[40,"blo00014",3],[41,"blo00002",160],[41,"blo00005",2],[42,"blo00008",3],[42,"blo00011",3],[42,"blo00014",3],[43,"blo00008",3],[43,"blo00011",3],[43,"blo00014",3],[44,"blo00008",3],[44,"blo00011",3],[44,"blo00014",3],[45,"blo00008",3],[45,"blo00011",3],[45,"blo00014",3],[46,"blo00002",160],[46,"blo00005",2],[47,"blo00008",3],[47,"blo00009",1],[47,"blo00011",3],[47,"blo00012",1],[47,"blo00014",3],[47,"blo00015",1],[48,"blo00008",3],[48,"blo00009",1],[48,"blo00011",3],[48,"blo00012",1],[48,"blo00014",3],[48,"blo00015",1],[49,"blo00008",3],[49,"blo00009",1],[49,"blo00011",3],[49,"blo00012",1],[49,"blo00014",3],[49,"blo00015",1],[50,"blo00008",3],[50,"blo00009",1],[50,"blo00011",3],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00014",3],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"大島雫、よろしくやで。肉体言語のことならウチにお任せっ！","en":"Ooshima Shizuku, nice to meet ya. If it's body language, leave it to me!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"そ。これが新装備やで。防御重視なところが、体術主体のウチにはぴったりやわ","en":"See? This is the new gear. Its defensive focus is perfect for me, since I'm all about body techniques."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"うん。この装備、なかなか格好ええやろ？　動きやすくてお気に入りやねん","en":"Yeah. This gear looks pretty good, right? It's easy to move in and it's my favorite."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"性能はええんやけど……この装備、胸のとこが目立つんがなぁ……。こんなんモロ、ないのがわかってしまうやんか……","en":"The performance's great, but… this gear makes my chest stand out… It's obvious there's nothing there…"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"先輩、今回こそは役に立ってみせますからね。装いも新たにしたウチのこと、よーく見といてください","en":"Senior, this time I'll prove I'm useful. Keep a close eye on the newly-dressed me, okay?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"先輩も胸が大きい人が好きなんですかっ？　いっ、いえ……。今のは忘れてください……","en":"Senior, do you like people with big chests? N-no… Forget what I just said…"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"先輩、どうですかねこれ？　この任務のための新装備なんです。……似合ってる？　わあ！　ありがとうございます！","en":"Senior, what do you think of this? It's new gear for the mission… Does it suit me? Wow! Thank you!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"この装備……もうちょい胸のとこ盛ることできひんかったんかなぁ……？　て、ウチはまだまだ成長期！　これから大きくなるから問題ないし！","en":"This gear… couldn't they have padded the chest a bit more? I'm still growing, so it'll get bigger, no problem!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":1,"text":{"ja":"だっ、誰がっ、くはっ……ナイ乳や！　人のん勝手に揉んどいて……文句まで……はんんっ、やめろぉ……！","en":"W-what? Who—ugh… No breasts! Someone's been squeezing them without permission… Even complaining… Stop…!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00420_1_hom_r18_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":2,"text":{"ja":"先輩以外に……感じさせられるなんてぇ……っ、屈辱……！　でもっ、んんあ！　でもぉ……ッ！　ああっ、ダメや！　やっ、やめぇ……！","en":"Besides you, senior… to be made to feel… ugh, humiliating… But… ah! But…! Ah, no! Stop…!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00420_1_hom_r18_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00420_1/uni00420_1_wav_1.ogg"}],"trust":[100],"scenes":[["chr_0293_r18"]],"stills":[["chr_0293a_r18"]],"obtain":[{"kind":"spark"